,"size":{"width":{"magnitude":11091672,"unit":"EMU"},"height":{"magnitude":1481328,"unit":"EMU"}},"transform":{"scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"translateX":548640,"translateY":4864608,"unit":"EMU"}}}},{"insertText":{"objectId":"sol6tn","insertionIndex":0,"text":"Why A wins, even though B reaches more people.  B reaches the 74% who never type anything, and it still loses. It scores 5 on confidence because no user asked for a form \u2014 the idea came from us. A wins on evidence: a test where only the date wording changed, plus three unprompted asks from two people for exactly this. B is next, not dropped.\nDeliberately left out:  fixing the dead end at step 5, which outside research rates first and we rate second. The MVP test is built to tell us if that ordering is wrong.\n"}},{"updateTextStyle":{"objectId":"sol6tn","textRange":{"type":"FIXED_RANGE","startIndex":0,"endIndex":46},"style":{"bold":true,"fontFamily":"Roboto","fontSize":{"magnitude":14,"unit":"PT"},"foregroundColor":{"opaqueColor":{"rgbColor":{"red":0.12549019607843137,"green":0.12941176470588237,"blue":0.1411764705882353}}}},"fields":"bold,fontFamily,fontSize,foregroundColor"}},{"updateTextStyle":{"objectId":"sol6tn","textRange":{"type":"FIXED_RANGE","startIndex":46,"endIndex":344},"style":{"bold":false,"fontFamily":"Roboto","fontSize":{"magnitude":14,"unit":"PT"},"foregroundColor":{"opaqueColor":{"rgbColor":{"red":0.37254901960784315,"green":0.38823529411764707,"blue":0.40784313725490196}}}},"fields":"bold,fontFamily,fontSize,foregroundColor"}},{"updateTextStyle":{"objectId":"sol6tn","textRange":{"type":"FIXED_RANGE","startIndex":344,"endIndex":366},"style":{"bold":true,"fontFamily":"Roboto","fontSize":{"magnitude":14,"unit":"PT"},"foregroundColor":{"opaqueColor":{"rgbColor":{"red":0.8509803921568627,"green":0.18823529411764706,"blue":0.1450980392156863}}}},"fields":"bold,fontFamily,fontSize,foregroundColor"}},{"updateTextStyle":{"objectId":"sol6tn","textRange":{"type":"FIXED_RANGE","startIndex":366,"endIndex":5